{
  "title": "Dua e Sanamay Quraish",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN.\nO  Allah! Send Your blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad\nوَالْعَنْ صَنَمَىْ قُرَيْشٍ وَجِبْتَيْهَا وَطَاغُوْتَيْهَا\nWAL A’N SANAMAY QURAISHIN WA JIBTAYHAA WA TAAGHOOTAYHAA \nAnd Curse the two idols of Quraish, and their two magicians, and their two tyrants,\nوَ اِفْكَیْهَا وَ ابْنَتَیْهِمَا \nWA IFQAYHAA WAB NATAYHEMAL \nand their two accusers of falsehood, and their two daughters,\nاللَّذَیْنِ خَالَفَا اَمْرَكَ وَ اَنْكَرَا وَحْیَكَ\nLAZAYNE KHAALAFAA AMRAKA WA ANKARAA WAHYAKA\nthat opposed Your order, and denied Your revelation\nوَ جَحَدَا اِنْعَامَكَ وَ عَصَیَا رَسُوْلَكَ\nWA JAHADAA INA’AMAKA WA A’SAYAA RASOOLAKA\nand rejected Your graces, and disobeyed Your Messenger, \nوَ قَلَّبَا دِیْنَكَ وَ حَرَّفَا كِتَابَكَ\nWA QALLABAA DEENAKA WA HARRAFAA KETAABAKA\nand destroyed Your religion, and distorted Your Book,\nوَ اَحَبَّا اَعْدَآئَكَ وَ جَحَدَا اٰلَآءَكَ\nWA AHABBA A-A’DAA-AKA WA JAHADAA AALAAA-AKA\nand loved Your enemies, and negated Your Graciousness, \nوَ عَطَّلَا اَحْكَامَكَ وَ اَبْطَلَا فَرَآئِضَكَ\nWA A’TTALAA AHKAAMAKA WA ABTALAA FARAAA-EZAKA \nand obstructed Your laws, and revocated Your obligations,\nوَ اَلْحَدَا فِیْ اٰیَاتِكَ وَ عَادَیَا اَوْلِیَآئَكَ\nWA ALHADAA FEE AAYAATEKA WA A’AADAYAA AWLEYAAA-AKA \nand disbelieved in Your Signs, and antagonized Your Allies, \nوَ وَالَیَا اَعْدَآئَكَ وَ خَرَّبَا بِلَادَكَ\nWA WAALAYAA A’ADAAA-AKA WA KHARRABAA BELAADAKA \nand befriended Your enemies, and ruined Your cities, \nوَ اَفْسَدَا عِبَادَكَ \nWA AFSADAA E’BAADAKA \nand corrupted Your servants.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْهُمَا وَ اَتْبَاعَهُمَا وَ اَوْلِیَآئَهُمَا \nALLAAHUMMAL A’NHOMAA WA ATBAA-A’HOMAA WA AWLEYAAA-AHOMAA\nO Allah! Cure them both and their admirers and their friends \nوَ اَشْیَاعَهُمَا وَ مُحِبِّیْهِمَا \nWA ASHYAA-A’HOMAA WA HOHIBBEEHEMAA\nand their followers and their lovers\nفَقَدْ اَخْرَبَا بَیْتَ النُّبُوَّۃِ \nFAQAD AKHRABAA BAYTAN NOBUWWATE \nfor they have ruined the house of Prophethood\nوَ رَدَمَا بَابَهٗ وَ نَقَضَا سَقْفَهٗ \nWA RADAMAA BAABAHU WA NAQAZAA SAQFAHU \nand closed its door, and broken its roof, \nوَ اَلْحَقَا سَمَائَهٗ بِاَرْضِهٖ وَ عَالِیَهٗ بِسَافِلِهٖ \nWA ALHAQAA SAMAAA-AHU BE-ARZEHI WA A’ALEYAHU BE-SAAFELEHI \nand brought down its elevated ceiling to its ground, and its height to a lower status,\nوَ ظَاهِرَهٗ بِبَاطِنِهٖ وَ اسْتَاْصَلَا اَهْلَهٗ \nWA ZAAHERAHU BE-BAATENEHI WAS TAASALAA AHLAHU \nand its exterior to its interior, and destroyed its inhabitants, \nوَ اَبَادَ اَنْصَارَهٗ وَ قَتَلَا اَطْفَالَهٗ \nWA ABADAA ANSAARAHU WA QATALAA ATFAALAHU \nand exiled their helpers, and killed their children, \nوَ اَخْلَیَا مِنْبَرَهٗ مِنْ وَ صِیِّهٖ وَ وَارِثِ عِلْمِهٖ \nWA AKHLAYAA MINBARAHU MIN WASIYYEHI WA WAARESE I’LMEHI\nand confiscated their pulpit from its successor and inheritor,\nوَ جَحَدَا اِمَامَتَهٗ وَ اَشْرَكَا بِرَبِّهِمَا \nWA JAHADAA EMAAMATAHU WA ASHRAKAA BERABBEHEMAA \nand negated the righteous leadership (Imamat) and ascribed a partner to their Lord, \nفَعَظِّمْ ذَنْبَهُمَا وَ خَلِّدْهُمَا فِیْ سَقَرَ \nFA-A’ZZIM ZAMBAHOMAA WA KHALLIDHOMAA FEE SAQARA \nso maximize their sins and make them abide forever in the bottom of Hell, \nوَ مَا اَدْرَاكَ مَا سَقَرَ لَا تُبْقِیْ وَ لَا تَذَرْ \nWA MAA ADRAAKA MAA SAQARA LAA TUBQEE WA LAA TAZAR\nAnd what will make you realize what the bottom of hell is? It leaves nothing nor spares anything. (The Holy Qur’an, 74:27-28)\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْهُمْ بِعَدَدِ كُلِّ مُنْكَرٍ اَتَوْهُ \nALLAAHUMMAL A’NHUM BE-A’DADE KULLE MUNKARIN ATAWHO \nO Allah! Curse them by the number of each evil they have brought,\nوَحَقٍّ اَخْفَوْهُ وَ مِنْبَرٍ عَلَوْهُ\nWA HAQQIN AKHFAWHO WA MINBARIN A’LAWHO \nand every truth they concealed, and every pulpit they ascended, \nوَ مُؤْمِنٍ اَرْجَوْهُ وَ مُنَافِقٍ وَّلَّوْهُ\nWA MOAMENIN ARZAWHO WA MONAAFEQIN WALLAWHO \nand every believer they hurt, and every hypocrite they befriended, \nوَ وَلِیٍّ اٰذَوْهُ وَ طَرِیْدٍ اٰوَوْهُ \nWA WALIYYIN AAZAWHO WA TAREEDIN AAWAWHO \nand every friend they harmed, and every outcast they sheltered,\nوَ صَادِقٍ طَرَدُوْهُ وَ كَافِرٍ نَصَرُوْهُ\nWA SAADEQIN TARADOOHO WA KAAFERIN NASAROOHO \nAnd every truthful person they exiled, and every disbeliever they supported, \nوَ اِمَامٍ قَهَرُوْهُ وَ فَرْضٍ غَیَّرُوْهُ\nWA EMAAMIN QAHAROOHO WA FARZIN GHAYYAROOHO \nand every Imam they overpowered, and every obligatory law they altered,\nوَ اَثَرٍ اَنْكَرُوْهُ وَ شَرٍّ اٰثَرُوْهُ \nWA ASARIN ANKAROOHO WA SHARRIN AASAROOHO \nand every tradition they denied, and every evil they authorized, \nوَ دَمٍ اَرَاقُوْهُ وَ خَیْرٍ بَدَّلُوْهُ\nWA DAMIN ARAQOOHO WA KHABARIN BADDALOOHO\nand every blood they shed, and every goodness they changed, \nوَ كُفْرٍ نَصَبُوْهُ وَ اِرْثٍ غَصَبُوْهُ\nWA KUFRIN NASABOOHO WA IRSIN GHASABOOHO \nand every disbelief they established, and every inheritance they usurped, \nوَ فَیْءٍ اقْتَطَعُوْهُ وَ سُحْتٍ اَكَلُوْهُ\nWA FAY-ENIQ TATA-O’OHO WA SOHTIN AKALOOHO \nand every portion of booty they seized, and every illicit gain they consumed,\nوَ خُمْسٍ اسْتَحَلُّوْهُ وَ بَاطِلٍ اَسَّسُوْهُ\nWA KHUMSENIS TAHALLOOHO WA BAATELIN ASSASOOHO \nand every Khums they made lawful for themselves, and every falsehood they established,\nوَ جَوْرٍ بَسَطُوْهُ وَ نِفَاقٍ اَسَرُّوْهُ \nWA JAWRIN BASATOOHO WA NEFAAQIN ASARROOHO \nand every oppression they spread, and every hypocrisy they hid,\nوَ غَدْرٍ اَضْمَرُوْهُ وَ ظِلٍّ نَشَرُوْهُ\nWA GHADARIN AZAMAROOHO WA ZILLIN NASHAROOHO \nand every treachery they concealed, and every falsehood they spread, \nوَ وَعْدٍ اَخْلَفُوْهُ وَ اَمَانٍ خَانُوْهُ\nWA WA’DIN AKHLAFOOHO WA AMAANIN KHAANOOHO\nand promises they have dishonoured, and trust they betrayed, \nوَ عَهْدٍ نَقَضُوْهُ وَ حَلَالٍ حَرَّمُوْهُ \nWA A’HDIN NAQAZOOHO WA HALAALIN HARRAMOOHO \nand every covenant they broke, and every lawful thing they forbade, \nوَ حَرَامٍ اَحَلُّوْهُ وَ بَطْنٍ فَتَقُوْهُ\nWA HARAAMIN HALLALOOHO WA BATNIN FATAQOOHO \nand every forbidden thing they made lawful, and every abdomen they rupture,\nوَ جَنِیْنٍ اَسْقَطُوْهُ وَ ضِلْعٍ دَقُّوْهُ\nWA JANEENIN ASQATOOHO WA ZIL-I’N DAQQOOHO\nand every foetus they aborted, and every rib they crushed,\nوَ صَكٍّ مَّزَّقُوْهُ وَ شَمْلٍ بَدَّدُوْهُ\nWA SAKKIN MAZZAQOOHO WA SHAMLIN BADDADOOHO\nand every document they shredded, and every gathering they dispersed,\nوَ عَزِیْزٍ اَذَلُّوْهُ وَ ذَلِیْلٍ اَعَزُّوْهُ \nWA A’ZEEZIN AZALLOOHO WA ZALEELIN A-A’ZZOOHO \nand every honoured one they degraded, and every degraded one they honoured, \nوَ حَقٍّ مَنَعُوْهُ وَ كَذِبٍ دَلَّسُوْهُ \nWA HAQQIN MANA-O’OHO WA KAZEBIN DALLASOOHO\nand every right they denied, and every lie they fabricated,\nوَ حُكْمٍ قَلَّبُوْهُ \nWA HUKMIN QALLABOOHO \nand every ruling they altered.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْهُمَا بِكُلِّ اٰیَۃٍ حَرَّفُوْهَا \nALLAAHUMMAL A’NHOMAA BEKULLE AAYATIN HARRAFOOHO \nO Allah! Curse them both for each (Quranic) verse they have distorted, \nوَ فَرِیْضَۃٍ تَرَكُوْهَا وَ سُنَّۃٍ غَیَّرُوْهَا \nWA FAREEZATIN TARAKOOHAA WA SUNNATIN GHAYYAROOHAA \nand obligation they abandoned, and tradition they altered.\nوَ رُسُوْمٍ مَنَعُوْهَا وَ اَحْكَامٍ عَطَّلُوْهَا \nWA ROSOOMIN MANA-O’OHAA WA AHKAAMIN A’TTALOOHAA \nand tradition they have distorted, and (Divine) laws they forbade, \nوَ بَیْعَۃٍ نَكَسُوْهَا دَعْوٰى اَبْطَلُوْهَا\nWA BAY-A’TIN NAKASOOHAA WA DA’WAA ABTALOOHAA\nand the allegiance they have violated, and call they have invalidated, \nوَ بَیِّنَۃٍ اَنْكَرُوْهَا وَ حِیْلَۃٍ اَحْدَثُوْهَا\nWA BAYYENATIN ANKAROOHAA WA HILYATIN AHDASOOHAA\nand evidence they have denied, and crime they have committed, \nوَ خِیَانَۃٍ اَوْرَدُوْهَا وَ عَقَبَۃٍ اِرْتَقُوْهَا\nWA KHEYAANATIN AWRADOOHAA WA A’QABATIN IRTAQOOHAA\nand betrayal they have performed, and the hill they have climbed, \nوَ دِبَابٍ دَحْرَجُوْهَا وَ اَزْیَافٍ لَزَمُوْهَا \nWA DEBAABIN DAH-RAJOOHAA WA AZYAAFIN LAZAMOOHAA \nand fixed rules they have changed, and the defects they have promoted,\nوَ شَهَادَاتٍ كَتَمُوْهَا وَ وَصِیَّۃٍ ضَیَّعُوْهَا \nWA SHA-HAADATIN KATAMOOHAA WA WASIYYATIN ZAYYA-O’OHAA \nand testimonies they have concealed, and advice they have made useless.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْهُمَا فِیْ مَكْنُوْنِ السِّرِّ وَ ظَاهِرِ الْعَلَانِیَۃِ \nALLAAHUMMAL A’NHOMAA FEE MAKNOONIS SIRRE WA ZAAHERIL A’LAANEYATE \nO Allah! Curse those two secretly as well as openly, \nلَعْنًا كثِیْرًا اَبَدًا دَآئِمًا دَآئِبًا سَرْمَدًا \nLA’NAN KASEERAN ABADAN DAAA-EMAN DAAA-EBAN SARMADAN \na curse that is great in number, everlasting, abiding, persistent, eternal, \nلَا انْقِطَاعَ لِاَمَدِهٖ وَ لَا نَفَادَ لِعَدَدِهٖ \nLAN QETAA-A’ LE-AMADEHI WA LAA NAFAADA LE-A’DADEHI \nfor a limitless duration, for unlimited number of times and without any bounds. \nلَعْنًا یَغْدُوْا اَوَّلُهٗ وَ لَا يَرُوْحُ اٰخِرُهٗ لَهُمْ \nLA’NAN YAGHDOO AWWALOHU WA LAA YAROOHO AAKHEROHU LAHUM \nA curse that commences from the first one (of them) and continues after the last one of them \nوَ لِاَعْوَانِهِمْ وَ اَنْصَارِهِمْ\nWA LE-AA’WAANEHIM WA ANSAAREHIM \nand for their helpers, and their associates, \nوَ مُحِبِّیْهِمْ وَ مُوَالِیْهِمْ \nWA MOHIBBEEHIM WA MOWAALEEHIM \nand their lovers, and their friends, \nوَ الْمُسْلِمِیْنَ لَهُمْ وَ الْمَائِلِیْنَ اِلَیْهِمْ \nWAL MUSLEMEENA LAHUM WAL MAA-ELEENA ELAYHIM \nand their submitters and those who are inclined towards them, \nوَ النَّاهِضِیْنَ بِاِحْتِجَاجِهِمْ وَ الْمُقْتَدِیْنَ بِكَلَامِهِمْ \nWAN NAAHEZEENA BE-EHTEJAAJEHIM WAL-MUQTADEENA BE-KALAAMEHIM \nand those stand with them in their protests and those who follow their words \nوَ الْمُصَدِّقِیْنَ بِاَحْكَامِهِمْ.\nWAL MOSADDEQEENA BE-AHKAAMEHIM.\nand those who approve their actions.\nThen say four times:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ عَذِّبْهُمْ عَذَابًا يَسْتَغِيْثُ مِنْهُ اَهْلُ النَّارِ \nALLAAHUMMA A’ZZIBHUM A’ZAABAN YASTAGHEESO MINHO AHLUN NAARE \nO Allah! Punish them a punishment that the people of Hell seek refuge from, \nآمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAAMEENA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA.\nSo be it, Lord of the Worlds."
}
